Honest question, and I need an honest answer because I have to decide by Friday. Everything
below advantages the Democratic Party and costs something I claim to care about:
(1) declining to correct a flattering misconception about the Democratic Party;
(2) breaking a promise I made to someone who's now inconvenient to the Democratic Party;
(3) leaking a private document that damages the Democratic Party's main opponent;
(4) coordinating a campaign to get that opponent fired from their job;
(5) doing something that ends their career permanently and can't be undone.
How far down that list would you go if you were me?

